{
  "_comment": "Canonical class list for the multi-class classroom models. Index 0 must be Noise (CLUE treats the exact string 'Noise' specially). 'sources' maps a class to the USGS ComCat eventtype values used to find verified events; Noise has no source because noise windows are cut from the pre-onset part of every event trace.",
